---
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section-base reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.08s;">
  <SectionHeading title="About" subtitle="Learning deeply, building thoughtfully" />
  <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr]">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-slate-950/40 backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-6">
      <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-base">
        I am passionate about understanding systems deeply, not just building applications. My focus is on modern
        web technologies, performance, and clean architecture. I enjoy reading books, listening to podcasts, and
        travelling, all of which sharpen my perspective as an engineer. I believe in continuous learning and
        self-improvement to keep growing with technology.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-slate-950/40 backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-6">
      <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sky-200">Education</h3>
      <p class="text-base font-medium text-slate-100">B.Tech</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">RK University</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
